      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "Total mRNA was extracted using the RNeasy Mini Kit (Qiagen) according to the manufacturer’s instructions. RNA was quantified using the NanoDrop 2000 spectrophotometer (Thermo Scientific). For RNA sequencing samples, RNA quality was assessed on a 2100 Bioanalyser (Agilent)."
      }, {
        "name" : "Hardware"
      } ]
