          "value" : "EFO_0005518"
        } ]
      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "Samples were prepared from four independent experiments where PC3M cells were treated with control or TCEAL1 siRNA and -/+ docetaxel for 48 hours before collecting total mRNA samples."
